<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said it started coverage of Ascend Communications Inc with short-term buy and long-term hold ratings.</p>
<p>-- Set fiscal 1996 earnings estimate at $0.97 per share, 1997 estimate at $1.45 per share.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 55-3/8 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
